      "comment": "Main init. IN: none (entry from JMP 0x0101). OUT: never returns. Sets SP=0x0100, clears VRAM, calls func_rom_init, func_decompress, func_sound_init, shows title, keyboard poll loop. Clobbers: all regs.",
